stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: DailyGroupShift created by\nFillFromRotationAsync
    Draft --> Active: Activate\n(ShiftOps.Activate)
    Draft --> Draft: Manual override / swap\n(Schedule.Override.Apply)

    state Active {
        [*] --> Running
        Running --> Running: Update attendance\n(Present/Late/Absent/Excused/OnLeave/Replaced)
        Running --> Running: Add / update / delete tasks\n(Pending → InProgress → Done/Blocked)
        Running --> Running: Log incidents\n(Low/Medium/High/Critical)
    }

    Active --> Closed: Close Shift\n(ShiftOps.Close)\n- requires closing summary\n- computes attendee/absent counts\n- creates ShiftReport (+ attachments)\n- rolls over unfinished tasks to\n  the group's next shift\n  (Status → HandedOver)
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Closed
        Once Closed:
        - No new tasks
        - No task deletion
        - No further attendance edits
        - No overrides
    end note
